  "$id": "https://github.com/lgtm-hq/py-lintro/blob/main/lintro/ai/review/checklist/corpus.schema.json",
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "description": "GENERATED FILE - do not hand-edit. Produced by scripts/generate-checklist-corpus-schema.py from the Python enums ReviewCategory and FileDomain, identify.identify.ALL_TAGS, and the tier/id bounds in lintro.ai.review.constants. Regenerate with `uv run python scripts/generate-checklist-corpus-schema.py` after changing any of those sources. Cross-row invariants (unique ids, unique normalized question text) are not expressible here and stay in lintro.ai.review.checklist.loader.",
